<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank allots 15.75 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank allots 15.75 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allotted 15.75 billion schillings in two-week securities repurchase agreements, or repos, at a fixed and unchanged rate of three percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 16 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank allotted 12.08 billion schillings, filling 12 percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 256</p>
</text>
